The MIT license above covers the code in this repository: aggregate.py,
build.py, src/template.html, assets/styles.css and assets/app.js.

It does not cover the underlying catalogue. Every figure on this site is
derived from:

  RVMT (RNA Virus MetaTranscriptomes), release RiboV1.4, February 2022.
  Neri U, Wolf YI, Roux S, et al. Expansion of the global RNA virome reveals
  diverse clades of bacteriophages. Cell. 2022;185(21):4023-4037.
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2022.08.023

That release is the work of its authors and its terms are set by the release,
not by this repository. No RVMT table is redistributed here: the three source
files total about 620 MB and stay outside the repository, and aggregate.py
reads them to produce data/data.json, which holds counts and summary
statistics only, no sequences and no per-contig records.

Anyone reusing the figures should cite Neri et al. rather than this site.
